WEBVTT

00:35:58.950 --> 00:36:02.407
And then I'm seeing, around me,

00:36:02.431 --> 00:36:06.376
children in school and education systems
in poor neighborhoods

00:36:06.400 --> 00:36:08.169
are sharing --

00:36:08.639 --> 00:36:10.426
They don't have adequate resources.

00:36:10.450 --> 00:36:12.403
There's no excuse.

00:36:12.704 --> 00:36:18.571
And so the idea that the profit system
can accomplish everything

00:36:18.595 --> 00:36:21.434
is not right.

00:36:21.458 --> 00:36:26.242
Because resource allocation
goes to those who have the resource.

00:36:26.266 --> 00:36:28.311
And so throughout all history,

00:36:28.335 --> 00:36:30.442
you go back hundreds of years,